#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:40
msgid "AI 智能助手"
msgstr "AI Smart Assistant"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:41
msgid "智能对话"
msgstr "Smart Chat"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:41
msgid "数据查询"
msgstr "Data Query"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:41
msgid "自动翻译"
msgstr "Auto Translation"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:41 app/data/features_guide_data.py:52
msgid "表单创建"
msgstr "Form Creation"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:42
msgid "内置 AI 聊天助手，支持自然语言查询业务数据、自动翻译、辅助创建表单，让日常工作更高效。"
msgstr ""
"A built-in AI chat assistant supports natural-language queries on "
"business data, auto-translation, and form creation to make daily work "
"more efficient.Built-in AI chat assistant supporting natural language "
"business data queries, auto-translation, and form creation assistance."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:44
msgid ""
"PMA 现已集成 AI 智能助手，您可以在系统内直接与 AI "
"进行对话。无论是查询客户信息、项目进度，还是分析销售数据，只需用自然语言描述需求，AI 即可快速给出答案。"
msgstr ""
"PMA now integrates an AI Smart Assistant for direct in-system "
"conversations. Whether querying customer information, project progress, "
"or analyzing sales data, simply describe your needs in natural language "
"and AI will quickly provide answers."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:45
msgid "AI 助手支持自动识别对话语言并进行翻译，方便中英文环境下的沟通协作。当您在聊天中 @AI 时，助手会自动参与对话并提供智能回复。"
msgstr ""
"The AI assistant auto-detects the conversation language and translates "
"it, easing collaboration across Chinese and English. When you @AI in "
"chat, the assistant joins the conversation and provides smart replies.The"
" AI assistant supports automatic language detection and translation for "
"Chinese-English collaboration. When you @AI in chat, the assistant "
"automatically joins the conversation with intelligent responses."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:46
msgid "此外，AI 助手还能辅助创建报价单、项目等表单，通过对话式交互引导您完成复杂的数据录入工作。"
msgstr ""
"The AI assistant can also help create quotations, projects, and other "
"forms, guiding you through complex data entry via "
"conversation.Additionally, the AI assistant helps create quotations, "
"projects, and other forms through conversational interaction, guiding you"
" through complex data entry."

# ===== 新功能说明书 - 场景轮播标题与描述 =====
#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:49
msgid "快速查询"
msgstr "Quick Query"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:49
msgid "用自然语言提问，如\"上个月我负责的项目有哪些？\"，AI 即时返回结果。"
msgstr ""
"Ask in natural language, e.g. \\\"Which projects did I own last "
"month?\\\", and AI returns results instantly.Ask in natural language, "
"e.g. \"What projects was I responsible for last month?\", and AI returns "
"results instantly."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:50
msgid "数据分析"
msgstr "Data Analysis"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:50
msgid "询问业务数据指标，如\"今年Q1的客户活跃度是多少？\"，获取数据洞察。"
msgstr ""
"Ask about business metrics, e.g. \\\"What was customer activity in Q1 "
"this year?\\\", to get data insights.Ask about business metrics, e.g. "
"\"What's the customer activity rate for Q1?\", to get data insights."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:51
msgid "翻译协助"
msgstr "Translation Help"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:51
msgid "在中英文对话中自动识别语言并翻译消息内容，跨语言沟通无障碍。"
msgstr ""
"Automatically detect the language and translate messages in Chinese-"
"English conversations for seamless cross-language communication.Auto-"
"detect language and translate messages in Chinese-English conversations "
"for seamless cross-language communication."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:52
msgid "通过对话式交互引导创建报价单、项目等表单，简化复杂数据录入。"
msgstr ""
"Guide quotation, project, and other form creation through conversation to"
" simplify complex data entry.Create quotations, projects and other forms "
"through conversational guidance, simplifying complex data entry."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:54
msgid "点击顶部导航栏右侧的聊天图标，或使用分屏模式打开 AI 面板"
msgstr ""
"Click the chat icon at the right of the top navbar, or use split view to "
"open the AI panelClick the chat icon on the top navigation bar, or use "
"split-screen mode to open the AI panel"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:56
msgid "点击导航栏右上角的聊天图标打开聊天面板"
msgstr "Click the chat icon in the top-right corner to open the chat panel"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:57
msgid "在输入框中输入您的问题或需求"
msgstr "Type your question or request in the input box"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:58
msgid "AI 会实时流式返回回答，支持 Markdown 格式"
msgstr "AI streams responses in real-time with Markdown formatting support"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:59
msgid "如需切换 AI 模型，可在面板顶部选择不同的 AI 提供商"
msgstr ""
"To switch AI models, choose a different AI provider at the top of the "
"panelTo switch AI models, select a different AI provider at the top of "
"the panel"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:68
msgid "积分系统"
msgstr "Points System"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:69
msgid "业绩积分"
msgstr "Performance Points"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:69
msgid "引用系数"
msgstr "Citation Coefficient"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:69
msgid "排行榜"
msgstr "Leaderboard"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:69
msgid "产品评分"
msgstr "Product Rating"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:70
msgid "基于业务贡献的积分激励体系，自动计算报价产品积分，实时显示个人积分排名。"
msgstr ""
"A points incentive system based on business contribution; quotation "
"product points are calculated automatically and personal rankings shown "
"in real time.A contribution-based points incentive system that auto-"
"calculates quotation product points and displays real-time personal "
"rankings."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:72
msgid "积分系统根据您的业务贡献自动计算积分。每当您创建或更新报价单时，系统会根据报价中产品的引用系数自动计算并记录积分。"
msgstr ""
"The points system calculates points automatically based on your business "
"contribution. Whenever you create or update a quotation, points are "
"computed and recorded from the citation coefficients of the products in "
"it.The points system automatically calculates points based on your "
"business contributions. When you create or update quotations, the system "
"auto-calculates and records points based on product citation "
"coefficients."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:73
msgid "每个产品都有对应的积分系数（引用系数），高价值或战略重点产品的系数更高。这意味着推广重点产品能获得更多积分奖励。"
msgstr ""
"Each product has a points coefficient (citation coefficient); high-value "
"or strategically important products have higher coefficients, meaning "
"promoting key products earns more points.Each product has a corresponding"
" points coefficient (citation coefficient), with higher values for "
"strategic products. Promoting key products earns more point rewards."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:74
msgid "积分以年度为周期，您可以在导航栏实时查看当前积分，也可以查看年度积分排行榜，了解自己在团队中的排名。"
msgstr ""
"Points run on an annual cycle. You can view your current points in real "
"time in the navbar, or check the annual leaderboard to see your team "
"ranking.Points reset annually. You can view your current points in the "
"navigation bar and check the annual leaderboard for team rankings."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:77
msgid "查看积分"
msgstr "View Points"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:77
msgid "导航栏顶部实时显示当前年度积分，随时掌握自己的业绩表现。"
msgstr ""
"The navbar shows your current annual points in real time so you always "
"know how you're performing.Real-time current year points displayed in the"
" top navigation bar, always track your performance."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:78
msgid "了解排名"
msgstr "Check Rankings"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:78
msgid "查看积分排行榜，了解自己在团队中的位置和差距。"
msgstr "View the leaderboard to understand your position and gap within the team."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:79
msgid "策略参考"
msgstr "Strategic Reference"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:79
msgid "根据产品积分系数选择推广重点，高系数产品带来更多积分奖励。"
msgstr ""
"Choose your promotion focus by product points coefficient; high-"
"coefficient products earn more points.Choose promotion focus based on "
"product point coefficients; high-coefficient products earn more rewards."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:80
msgid "业绩激励"
msgstr "Performance Incentive"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:80
msgid "积分作为绩效考核的参考指标之一，激励业务积极性。"
msgstr ""
"Points serve as one reference metric in performance reviews, motivating "
"business activity.Points serve as a performance evaluation metric, "
"motivating business initiative."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:82
msgid "导航栏顶部显示积分徽章，点击可查看积分详情"
msgstr ""
"A points badge appears at the top of the navbar; click it to view point "
"detailsPoints badge displayed at the top of the navigation bar; click to "
"view details"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:84
msgid "在导航栏顶部查看您的当前积分"
msgstr "View your current points at the top of the navigation bar"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:85
msgid "创建报价单并添加产品，系统自动计算积分"
msgstr "Create a quotation and add products; the system auto-calculates points"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:86
msgid "提交报价后积分自动记入您的账户"
msgstr ""
"Points are credited to your account automatically after submitting a "
"quotationPoints are automatically credited to your account after "
"submitting a quotation"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:87
msgid "查看排行榜了解团队积分排名"
msgstr "Check the leaderboard for team point rankings"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:96
msgid "资源池与访问申请"
msgstr "Resource Pool & Access Requests"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:97
msgid "跨权限搜索"
msgstr "Cross-Permission Search"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:97
msgid "访问请求"
msgstr "Access Request"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:97
msgid "资源共享"
msgstr "Resource Sharing"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:97
msgid "权限审批"
msgstr "Permission Approval"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:98
msgid "突破权限边界的资源发现机制，支持跨权限搜索客户资源并发起访问申请。"
msgstr ""
"A resource discovery mechanism that crosses permission boundaries, "
"supporting cross-permission customer search and access requests.A "
"resource discovery mechanism beyond permission boundaries, supporting "
"cross-permission customer search and access requests."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:100
msgid "资源池功能让您能够发现系统中超出个人权限范围的客户资源。当您搜索客户时，除了自己有权访问的数据外，还能看到其他同事管理的客户（以脱敏方式展示）。"
msgstr ""
"The resource pool lets you discover customer resources beyond your "
"personal permissions. When you search for customers, alongside data you "
"can access, you'll also see customers managed by other colleagues (shown "
"in masked form).The resource pool enables you to discover customer "
"resources beyond your permissions. When searching, you can see customers "
"managed by colleagues (displayed in anonymized form) in addition to your "
"own data."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:101
msgid "如果您发现某个客户与自己的业务相关，可以直接发起访问申请。申请会发送给该客户的负责人审批，审批通过后您即可获得查看权限。"
msgstr ""
"If you find a customer relevant to your business, you can request access "
"directly. The request is sent to the customer's owner for approval, and "
"once approved you gain view access.If you find a relevant customer, you "
"can directly submit an access request. The request goes to the customer's"
" owner for approval, and you gain viewing permission once approved."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:102
msgid "整个流程透明高效，既保护了数据安全，又促进了团队间的资源共享和业务协作。"
msgstr ""
"The whole process is transparent and efficient, protecting data security "
"while promoting resource sharing and collaboration across teams.The "
"entire process is transparent and efficient, protecting data security "
"while promoting resource sharing and business collaboration."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:105
msgid "发现潜在客户"
msgstr "Discover Potential Customers"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:105
msgid "搜索时发现其他同事管理的相关客户，锁定图标标识超出权限的资源。"
msgstr ""
"Discover relevant customers managed by other colleagues while searching; "
"a lock icon marks resources beyond your permissions.Discover related "
"customers managed by colleagues during searches; lock icons indicate "
"resources beyond your permissions."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:106
msgid "跨部门协作"
msgstr "Cross-Department Collaboration"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:106
msgid "申请访问其他部门的客户资源，促进联合开发和业务协同。"
msgstr ""
"Request access to other departments' customer resources to enable joint "
"development and collaboration.Request access to other departments' "
"customer resources, promoting joint development and business "
"collaboration."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:107
msgid "资源整合"
msgstr "Resource Integration"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:107
msgid "通过搜索发现系统中已有的客户，避免重复录入和资源浪费。"
msgstr ""
"Search to discover existing customers in the system and avoid duplicate "
"entry and wasted resources.Discover existing customers through search to "
"avoid duplicate entries and resource waste."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:108 app/templates/base.html:433
#: app/templates/base.html:467 app/templates/user/permissions.html:4
#: app/templates/user/permissions.html:108
#: app/templates/user/role_permissions.html:4
#: app/templates/user/role_permissions.html:20
msgid "权限管理"
msgstr "Permission"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:108
msgid "客户负责人在线审批他人的访问请求，流程透明可追溯。"
msgstr ""
"Customer owners approve others' access requests online, with a "
"transparent, traceable process.Customer owners approve access requests "
"online with a transparent and traceable process."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:110
msgid "在客户列表页面搜索时，超出权限的结果会显示锁定图标"
msgstr ""
"When searching the customer list, results beyond your permissions show a "
"lock iconWhen searching in the customer list, results beyond your "
"permissions show a lock icon"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:112
msgid "在客户搜索框输入关键词进行搜索"
msgstr "Enter keywords in the customer search box"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:113
msgid "搜索结果中带锁定图标的是超出权限的资源"
msgstr "Results with a lock icon are resources beyond your permissions"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:114
msgid "点击锁定图标或\"申请访问\"按钮发起申请"
msgstr "Click the lock icon or \"Request Access\" button to submit a request"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:115
msgid "填写申请理由并提交"
msgstr "Fill in the reason and submit"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:116
msgid "等待客户负责人审批，通过后自动获得访问权限"
msgstr ""
"Awaiting the customer owner's approval; access is granted automatically "
"once approvedWait for the customer owner's approval; access is granted "
"automatically upon approval"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:125
msgid "分屏浏览与消息通知"
msgstr "Split Screen & Notifications"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:126
msgid "分屏浏览"
msgstr "Split Screen"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:126
msgid "@提醒"
msgstr "@Mentions"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:126 app/helpers/at_dashboard_helpers.py:170
#: app/helpers/at_dashboard_helpers.py:1350
#: app/helpers/at_dashboard_helpers.py:1450
