msgid "待审批"
msgstr "Pending"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:126
#: app/templates/meeting/tw_meeting_minutes_detail.html:519
msgid "待办事项"
msgstr "To-Do Items"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:127
msgid "50/50 分屏布局支持边聊天边工作，消息通知面板集中显示 @提醒和待办事项。"
msgstr ""
"A 50/50 split layout lets you chat while you work, with a notification "
"panel centralizing @mentions and to-dos.50/50 split-screen layout for "
"chatting while working, with a notification panel for @mentions and to-do"
" items."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:129
msgid "分屏浏览功能将页面分为左右两半：左侧是聊天面板，右侧是您正在浏览的业务页面。这样您可以一边与同事或 AI 沟通，一边查看客户信息或编辑报价单。"
msgstr ""
"Split view divides the page into two halves: a chat panel on the left and"
" the business page you are viewing on the right. This lets you "
"communicate with colleagues or AI while viewing customer information or "
"editing a quotation.Split-screen divides the page in half: chat panel on "
"the left, business page on the right. Chat with colleagues or AI while "
"viewing customer information or editing quotations."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:130
msgid "消息通知面板集中展示所有需要您关注的事项：@您的聊天消息、待审批的项目/报销单、即将到期的任务等。点击通知可直接跳转到对应页面。"
msgstr ""
"The notification panel centralizes everything that needs your attention: "
"messages that @you, pending projects/expenses, upcoming due tasks, and "
"more. Click a notification to jump straight to the relevant page.The "
"notification panel displays all items requiring your attention: "
"@mentions, pending approvals for projects/expenses, upcoming task "
"deadlines, etc. Click notifications to jump directly to the relevant "
"page."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:131
msgid "分屏模式下导航栏会自动收窄，最大化利用屏幕空间。您可以随时切换分屏和全屏模式。"
msgstr ""
"In split view the navbar narrows automatically to maximize screen space. "
"You can switch between split and full view anytime.In split-screen mode, "
"the navigation bar auto-collapses to maximize screen space. Switch "
"between split and full-screen modes anytime."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:134
msgid "边聊边查"
msgstr "Chat & Browse"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:134
msgid "与同事讨论项目时同时查看项目详情，信息对照一目了然。"
msgstr ""
"View project details while discussing with colleagues, so information "
"lines up at a glance.View project details while discussing with "
"colleagues, with information comparison at a glance."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:135
msgid "AI 辅助"
msgstr "AI Assistance"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:135
msgid "一边使用 AI 助手获取信息，一边填写表单或编辑数据。"
msgstr ""
"Get information from the AI assistant while filling in forms or editing "
"data.Use the AI assistant for information while filling out forms or "
"editing data."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:136
msgid "消息追踪"
msgstr "Message Tracking"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:136
msgid "快速查看和处理 @提醒消息，不错过任何重要沟通。"
msgstr ""
"Quickly view and handle @mentions so you never miss an important "
"message.Quickly view and handle @mention messages, never miss important "
"communications."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:137
msgid "审批处理"
msgstr "Approval Processing"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:137
msgid "在通知面板中快速处理待审批事项，提升审批效率。"
msgstr ""
"Handle pending approvals quickly in the notification panel to boost "
"approval efficiency.Quickly handle pending approvals in the notification "
"panel, improving approval efficiency."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:139
msgid "点击导航栏的分屏图标切换分屏模式，点击铃铛图标打开消息面板"
msgstr ""
"Click the split-view icon in the navbar to toggle split view, or the bell"
" icon to open the notification panelClick the split-screen icon in the "
"navigation bar, or the bell icon to open the notification panel"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:141
msgid "点击导航栏右上角的分屏图标进入分屏模式"
msgstr ""
"Click the split-view icon in the top-right of the navbar to enter split "
"viewClick the split-screen icon in the top-right corner to enter split-"
"screen mode"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:142
msgid "左侧聊天面板自动展开，右侧显示当前页面"
msgstr ""
"The chat panel expands on the left, with the current page shown on the "
