msgstr ""
"Shows effective permissions (personal override > role default); "
"permissions override by whole module — changing any item writes the whole"
" module as a personal override, untouched modules keep inheriting role "
"defaults; '↺ Inherit' at the row end removes that module's override."

#: app/templates/user/at_person_permissions.html:46
msgid ""
"ⓘ 覆盖以模块为单位:模块被覆盖后,角色默认对该模块完全失效(包括「全不勾」=显式禁止);「↺ "
"继承」删除该模块覆盖并立即生效(页面其他未保存修改会一并丢弃);矩阵与「配置管理 · "
"权限配置」共用同一组件;「功能页签」(模块内部页签可见性)为角色级配置、无个人覆盖,请在 配置管理 → 权限配置 中调整。"
msgstr ""
"ⓘ Overrides apply per module: once a module is overridden, its role "
"default is fully replaced (including 'none checked' = explicitly denied);"
" '↺ Inherit' removes the module override and takes effect immediately "
"(other unsaved changes are discarded); the matrix shares the same "
"component as 'Config · Permissions'; 'Feature tabs' (in-module tab "
"visibility) are role-level config with no personal override — adjust them"
" in Config → Permissions."

